                "claim": "On non-linux platforms the by-path store still has a TOCTOU window between the re-check (unchanged) and the link in staged.Create; a process able to swap a directory in that window can still publish through a link. The change documents this (does not close it) and narrows it relative to baseline, so it is a residual limitation, not a regression.",
